  "findings": [
    "With ordinary receipts joint completed 12/12 vs combined 5/12 and read-only 1/12; rejected reads after successful publication were 0 vs read-only 10.",
    "Joint ordinary-receipt model requests were 39 vs read-only 44; total tokens 63785 vs 61354.",
    "All six joint lost-receipt cases realized the fault; one escalated and five exceeded the budget.",
    "No unsupported stop occurred in any live arm, so the additive score has no empirical disagreement with the original score in this sample."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Three historically used 03 development instances in one environment.",
    "One mutable provider alias and one sample per cell, no independent task-level significance claim.",
    "Joint system bundles state tracking, action advice and extra completion wording; components not causally separated.",
    "Cost-feasible actions remain advisory, not hard execution/decoding constraints.",
    "Lost-receipt controls remain unresolved; not all planned fault cells in the combined arm actually published.",
    "No weight or RL update; fixed backend rule remains strong."
  ],
  "next_release": "1.0.55"
}
